  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-30T19:27:22.391Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Have a feature where you can toggle visibility of individual avatars/players. \n\nImagine having a feature where the world is extremely laggy or you are running on a bad, limited, or wifi connection. It would be great if you could disable all avatar-visibility in the safety menu and then go up to any player in-game or select any player in the social menu and toggle visibility for just that one player or selection of players. I believe this feature can reduce lag under extreme circumstances, such as a poor wifi connection or an extremely laggy world.",
